  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-27T06:52:12.077Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Since the EAC update, Virtual Desktop doesn't work anymore with the Oculus VRChat version.\nUsing the Oculus VRChat version is far superior in terms of performance, lags and freezes in busy world instances (>40) compared to using the SteamVR VRChat version. \nAirlink algorithms are far inferior too as soon as you move a lot (dance clubs)\nYou'll see a lot of crappy artefacts / interlaced and tearing.\nI've ran multiple tests with different PCs and configurations, and everytime there's no doubt about it and always came back to running the Oculus VRChat version through VD. \nPlease work with the virtual Desktop Creator / EAC to keep allowing it to work . \nThanks.",
